  "description": "Subject: Summary of LISA Account\u202fACC12345 (Reference\u202fZ123456)\n\nDear Client,\n\nYour Lifetime ISA (LISA) under account\u202fACC12345, managed with reference number\u202fZ123456 and held for investor\u202f0123456789, opened on\u202f2022\u201101\u201101 and scheduled to close on\u202f2025\u201112\u201131, remains in an **open** status with a health status recorded as **default**. The account\u2019s web portal can be accessed via the self\u2011link \u201c/accounts/ACC12345\u201d.  \n\nRegarding significant events, a death notification was logged for a date of death on\u202f2025\u201106\u201115, with the notification received on\u202f2025\u201106\u201116\u202fT09:45:00\u202fZ. Earlier, a terminal\u2011illness notification was recorded on\u202f2024\u201111\u201110\u202fT14:20:00\u202fZ.  \n\nThe financial history is broken into two reporting periods. **Period\u202f1** (self\u2011link \u201c/periods/1\u201d) covers\u202f2022\u201101\u201101\u202fto\u202f2022\u201112\u201131, and the first subscription for this period was made on\u202f2022\u201101\u201102\u202fT08:00:00\u202fZ. **Period\u202f2** (self\u2011link \u201c/periods/2\u201d) spans\u202f2023\u201101\u201101\u202fto\u202f2023\u201112\u201131; no first\u2011subscription timestamp is recorded for this interval."
